00||BCD frequency data (length not detailed in this manual)|Send frequency data (transceive)|Data format only described as BCD code data for frequency
01||mode data (same as command 06)|Send mode data (transceive)|"Same as command 06"
02||none (read)|Read band edge frequencies|
03||BCD frequency data|Read operating frequency|
04||mode data|Read operating mode|
05||BCD frequency data|Set operating frequency|
06|00|none|Select LSB|mode code = sub-command column in this manual
06|01|none|Select USB|
06|02|none|Select AM|
06|03|none|Select CW|
06|04|none|Select RTTY|
06|05|none|Select FM|
